  (text "J48 GAL / PAL Programmer (AVR16DU28) - Rev I: J5 expansion header" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5d5a7f9c-e9cc-5bf4-9c5e-3113c05f25c7"))
  (text "Connectivity is by net label on each pin stub. Footprints are not assigned. Generated from the Rev I netlist; run ERC after opening." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25aa5951-378c-5c07-b5a6-d0ee96466e9b"))
  (text "ZIF-28 switching (new in Rev H): U9 595 drives SCLK/SDIN/STB, BOOST_EN and the GND/VCC switches. All switches off at reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb264ec5-d1c4-595e-9ff2-05b6ee46c200"))
  (text "Logic supply select (new in Rev G): VSYS = 5 V or 3.3 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 340 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "09b996db-b8c2-5d20-a90f-a828f8c0b184"))
  (text "J4 5V position: shunts 1-3 + 2-4 -> VSYS = +5V, VUSB from U1's internal USB regulator (USBVREG = 1).\nJ4 3V3 position: shunts 3-5 + 4-6 -> VSYS = +3V3, VUSB tied to VDD; firmware writes SYSCFG.VUSBCTRL.USBVREG = 0.\nMove shunts only with USB unplugged; both on the same side. Firmware reads VDD via the ADC at boot (no pin free for a sense line).\nRev G value changes: U3 MCP4821 at 1x gain (GA = 1); R26 75k (VPP = DAC x 8.5); R16 68k with the 2.500 V ADC reference;\nQ1 must be logic-level (AO3400); at 3.3 V keep SPI SCK <= 8 MHz for the 74HC595." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 395 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86f0b7d2-6beb-5d69-9d9c-a560b994272b"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
